へへ。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/pout"},{"n":110,"text":"頑張らないとね。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/pout"},{"n":111,"text":"韓国史なんて、冗談抜きで試験の1か月前からでも間に合います。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base","draft":true},{"n":112,"text":"でも、韓国史は面白いのに...。","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":113,"text":"じゃあ、韓国史だけやって、あとは全部9級でいいんじゃないですか？","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired"},{"n":114,"text":"ごめんね⋯...。","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired"},{"n":115,"text":"あーほんとに何でそんなに謝るんだ!!!！","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/startled","fx":"shake"},{"n":116,"text":"そんなに謝るならもうちょっとやれよ！","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/startled"},{"n":117,"text":"私だって忙しいのに、あーもう。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired"},{"n":118,"text":"⋯⋯","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired"},{"n":119,"text":"携帯貸してよ。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":120,"text":"え......えっ......どうして？","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":121,"text":"私の携帯はダメよ......。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":122,"text":"紗夜に検索履歴を見られたら捕まっちゃうよ......。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":123,"text":"あ、いいわよ、別に見ないから早く!!!！","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/startled"},{"n":124,"text":"うーん......。","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/startled"},{"n":125,"text":"（カタカタ）","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/startled","sfx":"typing"},{"n":126,"text":"紗夜がユーチューブに入り、何回かタイプすると、受験のカリキュラムの映像を見せた。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/startled"},{"n":127,"text":"これを見て、勉強の仕方を整理してね。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":128,"text":"お兄ちゃん、せめて学校に行っていれば、どんな科目ができるかはわかるはずでしょう？","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":129,"text":"その......ね。","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":130,"text":"韓国語は読めるから、せめて国語の方がマシだけど......。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":131,"text":"それを見て、勉強をどうするか考えてみてよ。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":132,"text":"お兄ちゃんの人生、どんだけ生食してきたんだよ、こんなにバカなの？","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired"},{"n":133,"text":"これからは勉強するときは、私の部屋でやればいいわよ。 つらいから。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":134,"text":"わからないことあったら聞いていい？","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":135,"text":"一人で調べてから聞いてください。 1+1みたいなこと聞いちゃいそうだから......。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":136,"text":"⋯⋯。","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":137,"text":"まさか足し算引き算も知らないわけじゃないよね？","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/grin"},{"n":138,"text":"いやいや、知ってるよ。","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/grin"},{"n":139,"text":"じゃあ、ちょっとやってよ。私は仕事してるから、それが終わるまで邪魔しないでね。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":140,"text":"うん......わかった。","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":141,"text":"その後、紗夜は作業に集中し始めた。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":142,"text":"静かな部屋にはキーボードの音しか聞こえなかった。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":143,"text":"勉強を......ここまで計画的にやるんだね。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":144,"text":"私は何も知らずに、ただ頭でっかちでやってたのに。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":145,"text":"本当は勉強もせず、ゲームばかりしていたけど。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":146,"text":"頭叩くっていうと、またやりたくなるね。私、また打ち込みの達人なのに。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":147,"text":"うーん......受験うまくいくかなあ。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":148,"text":"無駄なこと考えないで早く整理してくださいよ。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired"},{"n":149,"text":"だから虚しい日は勉強ができない。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired"},{"n":150,"text":"うーん、ごめんね...。","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired"},{"n":151,"text":"⋯あ......あー、マジで。ほら、見てよ。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired"},{"n":152,"text":"紗夜がペンを取ってノートを開いた。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired"},{"n":153,"text":"これがコーネル整理法とかいうやつなんだけど、こっちは大事なこと書いて、こっちは本文書いて......。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":154,"text":"紗夜があまりに言い過ぎたのが申し訳なかったのか、整理の仕方を教えてくれた。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":155,"text":"こんなに熱心に教えてくれた人がいたっけ？","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":156,"text":"面倒くさいはずなのに、ありがたかったし、友達ができたような気がして嬉しかった。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base"},{"n":157,"text":"何してるんですか。聞いてます？","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base","draft":true},{"n":158,"text":"うん⋯⋯でも、なんでこんなに教えてくれるの？","who":"player","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base","draft":true},{"n":159,"text":"別に大した理由じゃないですけど⋯⋯私、やりたいことができたとき、方向を教えてくれる人がいなかったんです。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/pout","draft":true},{"n":160,"text":"お兄ちゃんがそんなにバカなのも分かります。何も知らないし、教えてくれる人もいなかったんでしょうね。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/pout","draft":true},{"n":161,"text":"それでも、挑戦してること自体がすごいんですよ。途方に暮れてるはずなのに。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base","draft":true},{"n":162,"text":"褒められてるのかけなされてるのか分からなくて、こみ上げかけた気持ちが引っ込んだ。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/base","draft":true},{"n":163,"text":"とにかく、集中して聞いてください。二度は言いませんから。","who":"saeun","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired","draft":true},{"n":164,"text":"そうして、紗夜と一緒に勉強に励んだ。","bg":"saeun-room","stand":"saeun/tired","draft":true}]}],"images":{"bg":{"living-evening":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/bg/living-evening.webp","living-night":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/bg/living-night.webp","room-night":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/bg/room-night.webp","saeun-room":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/bg/saeun-room.webp"},"ecg":{"jihye-cooking":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/ecg/jihye-cooking.webp"},"stand":{"jihye/awkward":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/jihye-awkward.webp","jihye/cry":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/jihye-cry.webp","jihye/grin":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/jihye-grin.webp","jihye/happy":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/jihye-happy.webp","jihye/interest":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/jihye-interest.webp","jihye/smile":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/jihye-smile.webp","jihye/worry":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/jihye-worry.webp","saeun/base":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/saeun-base.webp","saeun/grin":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/saeun-grin.webp","saeun/pout":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/saeun-pout.webp","saeun/startled":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/saeun-startled.webp","saeun/surprised":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/saeun-surprised.webp","saeun/tired":"/elyweb/previews/final/habom/sharehouse-demo/img/stand/saeun-tired.webp"}}}
